  "text": {
    "paragraphs": [
      "I am Lily. I am a girl. I am seven. I have two hands. I have two arms. I have two legs. I have two feet. My hair is black. It is long.",
      "This is my grandfather. He is old. His hair is white. It is short. He has ten toys. They are for me. He is very nice.",
      "\"Grandpa, look at me!\" \"I have two hands.\" Grandpa smiles. \"I have two hands too.\" \"Do you have a grandfather?\" I love my grandfather."
    ],
